==History==
2021
*The Golden Knight [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 27/10/2021, in the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]].
*On 1/11/2021, an [[Version History#Optional%20Update%20(1/11/2021)|Optional Update]], fixed Dashing Dash so that it does not end if the Golden Knight's target dies before the dash connects with it.
2022
*On 3/2/2022, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/2/2022)|Balance Update]], decreased the Dashing Dash's maximum dash range to 5 tiles (from 6 tiles) and increased its cooldown time to 11 seconds (from 8 seconds).
*On 30/3/2022, the [[Version History#Miner%20Update%20(30/3/2022)|Miner Update]], fixed an issue with Golden Knight not dashing properly while targeting a moving unit.
*On 4/4/2022, the [[Version History#April%202022%20Update%20(4/4/2022)|April 2022 Update]], increased the Dashing Dash's maximum dash range to 6 tiles (from 5 tiles) but made it so that the dash would end if a [[:Category:Crown Towers|Crown Tower]] is hit.
*On 2/8/2022, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(2/8/2022)|Balance Update]], decreased the Golden Knight's hitpoints by 10%.
*On 26/10/2022, the [[Version History#2022%20Quarter%203%20Update%20(26/10/2022)|2022 Quarter 3 Update]], moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock the Golden Knight from [[Training Camp]] to Executioner's Kitchen. This also made it so that players at any [[Experience|King Level]] could unlock the Golden Knight, as opposed to only Level 14. It also fixed an issue where Golden Knight dashed to an empty space with no target.
2023
*On 4/4/2023, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(4/4/2023)|Balance Update]], decreased the Dashing Dash's maximum dash range to 5.5 tiles (from 6 tiles).
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).
*On 13/11/2023, a [[Version History#Minor%20Update%20(13/11/2023)|Minor Update]], fixed a bug where Golden Knight could not hit targets across the river with Dashing Dash.
2024
*On 3/1/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/1/2024)|Balance Update]], increased the Dashing Dash's damage by 8%.
*On 5/3/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (5/3/2024)|Balance Update]], decreased the Dashing Dash’s cooldown to 8 seconds (from 11 seconds).
*On 17/6/2024, the [[Version History#Goblin World Update (17/6/2024)|Goblin World Update]], decreased the Golden Knight's hitpoints by 0.05% and increased his damage by 0.625%.
2025

* On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], allowed a dashing Golden Knight to be affected by [[Royal Chef]].
* On 5/5/2025, the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (5/5/2025)|May 2025 Update]], allowed Dashing Dash to move Golden Knight backwards.
* On 3/11/2025, a Balance Update, decreased Dashing Dash Delay to 0.05 seconds (from 0.2 seconds).
2026

* On 12/1/2026, a Balance Update, decreased the cooldown of Dashing Dash to 12 seconds (from 8 seconds).

